# [RATS](../wg/rats.html)

## Summary

The Remote ATtestation ProcedureS (RATS) Working Group held a session to review working group draft statuses, progress updates, and technical proposals across several active specification areas. Key topics discussed included updates on Concise Reference Integrity Manifest (CoRIM), EAT Device Assignment (EAT DA), Concise Selector for Endorsements and Reference Values (CoSERV), Evidence Transformations, EAT Attestation Results (EAR) and Attestation Results for Secure Interactions (AR4SI), Remote Attestation with Multiple Verifiers, Verifiable Proof of Environment, Geographic Attestation Results, and Epoch Markers.

