### Evidence Transformations
* Presentation: [Evidence Transformations](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-rats-evidence-transformations-00)
* Speaker: **Ned Smith** (chaired by **Chris Inacio**)
* Specification: [`draft-ietf-rats-evidence-trans`](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-rats-evidence-trans/)
* **Key Updates**:
  * Updated transformations to support SPDM 1.2 and 1.3+ structures, including SOH headers and subspecial addresses (`0x0570` for CoEV, `0x0018` for `COSE_Sign1`).
  * Converting structured text transformations into normative pseudocode matching the format used in [`draft-ietf-rats-corim`](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-rats-corim/).
  * Updated concise evidence translation to accommodate CoMID changes (code points 60–20), domain triples for trust dependencies, and constraint handling (evidence singleton values vs. reference value ranges).

