### Geographic Attestation Results
* Presentation: [Geographic Results (v2) explanation and issues](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-rats-geographic-results-v1-explanation-and-issues-01)
* Speaker: **Michael Richardson**
